    {"v": IN_N.voltage, "what": "vcm_abs_IN_N", "lo": -0.3 * derate, "hi": 85.0 * derate},
    "error",
)

# vbus_abs_VBUS: pin VBUS (VBUS) within the limit, x derate
#   Bus voltage input, VBUS: min -0.3 / max 85 V
#   DS p.3, 6.1 Absolute Maximum Ratings, VBUS
#   Conditions: over operating free-air temperature range (unless otherwise noted)
#   Severity error: abs_max violated
_limit(
