# vio_abs_ALERT: pin ALERT (ALERT) within the limit, x derate
#   Digital input/output voltage, MOSI, MISO, SCLK, ALERT: min -0.3 / max 0.3 V (min_ref rel. GND) (max_ref rel. VS)
#   DS p.3, 6.1 Absolute Maximum Ratings, VIO, MOSI, MISO, SCLK, ALERT
#   Conditions: over operating free-air temperature range (unless otherwise noted)
